WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:08.042
The Freezies loaded their spaceship.

2
00:00:08.043 --> 00:00:10.885
Ringo and Bot helped.

3
00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:18.464
Ringo carried tools with Zoop.

4
00:00:18.465 --> 00:00:24.524
Their feet splashed in the water.

5
00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:29.509
Zoop looked up at the planet's sun.

6
00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:33.407
"The sun is getting even bigger," he said.

7
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:39.502
He wiped his forehead. "And hotter!"

8
00:00:39.503 --> 00:00:42.607
"Uh-oh," a Freezie cried.

9
00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:46.184
"The mountain is moving!"

10
00:00:46.185 --> 00:00:48.614
Ringo looked up.

11
00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:52.433
He saw a big chunk of ice.

12
00:00:52.434 --> 00:00:58.396
The ice chunk slid down the mountain.

13
00:00:58.397 --> 00:01:02.264
It was coming toward the village!

14
00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:06.531
"Everyone! Get out of the way!" Ringo called.

15
00:01:06.532 --> 00:01:11.510
Freezies ran out of the ice chunk's path.

16
00:01:11.511 --> 00:01:15.580
The ice came to a stop.

17
00:01:15.581 --> 00:01:20.108
"Whew! That was close," Ringo said.

18
00:01:20.109 --> 00:01:23.555
Then big cracks formed under the chunk.

19
00:01:23.556 --> 00:01:31.376
Crack! Ringo saw the ice break apart.

20
00:01:31.377 --> 00:01:39.279
Now there was a big sea.

21
00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.618
"Uh-oh, Zoop," Ringo said.

22
00:01:42.619 --> 00:01:44.125
"Your spaceship!

23
00:01:44.126 --> 00:01:49.435
It's on the other side of the water."

24
00:01:49.436 --> 00:01:52.107
"Freezies!" Zoop yelled.

25
00:01:52.108 --> 00:01:57.379
"We must swim to our spaceship!"

26
00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.908
Suddenly something rose from the water.

27
00:02:00.909 --> 00:02:05.283
Ringo gasped. "What's that?"

28
00:02:05.284 --> 00:02:09.320
"A spacefish!" Bot said.

29
00:02:09.321 --> 00:02:12.758
The spacefish opened its huge mouth.

30
00:02:12.759 --> 00:02:15.099
It chomped the spaceship.

31
00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:20.281
Crunch!

